BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Littoralicious//Terroir Catania//EN
X-WR-CALNAME:Catania — eat & drink checklist
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:catania-liste-1@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Granita di mandorla con brioche — Almond ice\, coarse-grained\, with a warm brioche col tuppo.
DESCRIPTION:Say: gra-NEE-ta dee man-DOR-la. Breakfast in Catania\, all year. Best: Pasticceria Savia\, Via Etnea
LOCATION:Pasticceria Savia\, Via Etnea
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pasticceria+Savia+Catania+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:catania-liste-2@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Arancino al ragù — Fried rice cone filled with meat ragù and peas.
DESCRIPTION:Say: a-ran-CHEE-no. In Catania it is masculine and pointed\; the Accademia della Crusca accepts both forms. Best: Pasticceria Savia\, Catania
LOCATION:Pasticceria Savia\, Catania
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pasticceria+Savia+Catania+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:catania-liste-3@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Cipollina — Puff pastry round with onion\, ham\, tomato and cheese.
DESCRIPTION:Say: chee-pol-LEE-na. A rosticceria piece found almost only in Catania. Best: Pasticceria Quaranta\, Ognina
LOCATION:Pasticceria Quaranta\, Ognina
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pasticceria+Quaranta+Catania+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:catania-liste-4@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Crudo di gambero rosso — Raw red prawns\, from the stalls outside.
DESCRIPTION:Say: KROO-do. Eat it at the room that buys from the market. Best: Osteria Antica Marina\, Pescheria
LOCATION:Osteria Antica Marina\, Pescheria
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Osteria+Antica+Marina+Catania+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:catania-liste-5@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Arrusti e mancia — 'Roast and eat' — horse meat on the street.
DESCRIPTION:Say: ar-ROOS-tee eh MAN-cha. The Via Plebiscito grills\; here it goes inside an arancino. Best: Canusciuti\, Catania
LOCATION:Canusciuti\, Catania
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Canusciuti+Catania+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:catania-liste-6@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Scacciata — A closed pie of bread dough with broccoli or tuma.
DESCRIPTION:Say: shak-CHA-ta. Catania's own\; at a fry shop of several generations. Best: Antica Friggitoria Stella\, Catania
LOCATION:Antica Friggitoria Stella\, Catania
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Antica+Friggitoria+Stella+Catania+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:catania-liste-7@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Seltz limone e sale — Fresh lemon squeezed into soda water with a pinch of salt.
DESCRIPTION:Say: SELTS lee-MO-ne eh SA-le. Catania's kiosk drink\, for heat and for the morning after. Best: Chiosco Giammona\, Piazza Umberto
LOCATION:Chiosco Giammona\, Piazza Umberto
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Chiosco+Giammona+Catania+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:catania-liste-8@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Etna Bianco Superiore — Carricante from the commune of Milo.
DESCRIPTION:Say: BYAN-ko soo-pe-RYO-re. Only Milo may call its Etna white Superiore. Best: Benanti\, Viagrande — Pietra Marina
LOCATION:Benanti\, Viagrande — Pietra Marina
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Benanti+Viagrande+Sicilia
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:catania-liste-9@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Granita al pistacchio — Pistachio granita\, the indulgent order.
DESCRIPTION:Say: pee-STAK-kyo. On the slope above town\, with summer queues to prove it. Best: Bar Alecci\, Gravina di Catania
LOCATION:Bar Alecci\, Gravina di Catania
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bar+Alecci+Gravina+di+Catania+Sicilia
END:VTODO
END:VCALENDAR
